  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.32 - Property-level AM004/AM006 diagnostics\n\n            Changed:\n            - AM004 reports missing destination-property diagnostics on the offending source property identifier\n            - AM006 reports unmapped destination-property diagnostics on the offending destination property identifier\n            - AM004/AM006 diagnostics carry mapping invocation span metadata so existing code fixes still locate the CreateMap chain\n            - Shared code-fix test verification tolerates line-ending-only generated-source diffs across Windows/LF checkouts\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (819 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - Codex review passing per change\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.31 - Correctness and code-fix hardening from an adversarial analyzer audit",
